    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Audit partition free (STIG)",
      "description": "Its own panel because it is not an ordinary filesystem. auditd's disk_full_action decides what happens at zero and that can include halting the machine. Alerted at 25% free, wider than anything else.",
